WEBVTT

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:15.900
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.900
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.440
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.940
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:29.230
Pavel tells Kasel about King Kyle and Arlette,

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:31.980
and Kasel renews his convictions.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.520
Pavel joins the group
to travel to the World Tree,

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.560
where the Holy Sword is sealed.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:42.270
Meanwhile, Malduk opens the dimensional rift

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.350
to summon the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.310
We welcome your arrival, Dark Lord.

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:53.350
What are you talking about? This is--

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:58.020
Silence! This is the Dark Lord Angmund himself.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:00.940
The destroyer of the world.

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:03.350
No...

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:11.060
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:16.310
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:26.730
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:31.150
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:35.690
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:40.940
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:45.600
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.940
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.770
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:55.400
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:57.940
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:01.900
<i>I search for you</i>

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:05.310
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:10.190
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:12.850
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:15.060
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.480
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:19.940
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:23.150
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:27.020
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:40.930
<i></i>To the

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:40.930
<i></i>World Tree

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:13.940
Yes, good... Continue to sow fear
and confusion in the world.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:18.350
Once we destroy the Holy Sword,

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:22.560
nothing will be able to stop the Dark Lord!

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:38.400
Oh, I can see the Forest of Elidora!

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:49.810
I never thought it would
be possible to return so quickly.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:53.520
Lorraine must be aware of
the change in the world.

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:56.650
Let's hurry to the World Tree.

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:58.060
Yes.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:04.520
The Demons are becoming more active.

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.560
There is no doubt that
the Dark Lord has returned.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:12.020
It seems Kasel and the others
were not able to stop it from happening.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.690
All we can do is pray that they are safe.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:16.900
Yes...

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:21.480
If the Dark Lord begins using
his own power, it would be far worse.

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:26.770
A huge battle is coming.
We must prepare diligently.

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.270
Yes.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:37.310
I hear water.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:40.690
All right, let's split up
and gather food and water.

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:41.210
Yeah.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.310
I'll go with you.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:47.440
I'd like to get something nice
to eat for a change...

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:53.850
Um...

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:59.440
I'd like to ask one question to Master Pavel,
a great, great elder sorcerer...

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.100
What is it?

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:05.100
How did you learn such awesome magic?

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.400
Is there a tip or trick?

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.310
Which tome did you study the most?

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:12.060
Is there an exercise you do every day?

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.770
Do you have a motto?

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.730
I thought you had one question.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.600
I'm sorry.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:22.400
You're such a wonderfully awesome person,
so I couldn't help it...

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:26.650
I just want to know how I can become like you.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.900
You and I are different.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:31.690
Well, that's true...

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:34.560
Master Pavel and I are like water and oil...

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.150
Er, I mean, ice and fire.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:39.270
Master Pavel is a solitary person,

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:43.850
but no way would I be able
to spend 100 years alone.

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:47.600
That makes us way different, but...

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.020
What are you trying to say?

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:54.690
In order to defeat the Dark Lord with Kasel,
I think I need to be much stronger.

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:59.310
Just like Master Pavel, who defeated
the Dark Lord once with King Kyle.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:02.270
If you have any advice...

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:07.020
Advice... Unfortunately, I have none.

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:11.980
When King Kyle was fighting the Dark Lord,
I was not by his side.

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:14.150
Really?

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:21.980
Neither myself, Lorraine, nor Aeatola
saw King Kyle's final battle.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:26.400
The only person who saw it was that saintess...

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.400
Saintess?

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.810
We all share a deep regret.

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:35.980
That's why we all wish to support
Kasel in any way we can.

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.190
For King Kyle.

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.400
I'm sorry I couldn't offer any advice.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:46.600
But all you have to do is
support Kasel in any way you can.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:07:03.350
You seem to have inherited the strong will
of both King Kyle and Arlette.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:04.440
What's wrong?

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:11.310
Oh... I was just wondering what
King Kyle was like, as a person.

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:16.980
Yeah, we all know he's a hero that was
liked by everyone, but beyond that...

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:19.020
What do you think?

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:21.850
I honestly don't know.

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:25.520
I also don't have a concrete feeling
that he's my father.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:30.020
That's natural... You've never met him.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:35.100
But recently, I've started to feel
that King Kyle is closer to me.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.850
Really?

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.940
During our travels,

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:44.400
I started to think about
how King Kyle felt back then.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:47.440
He had the strong conviction
to protect everyone,

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:52.440
but he also must have had an equal amount
of fear and nervousness.

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:57.980
Yes, I'm sure King Kyle went
through a lot of pain, too.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:02.270
But he got over that to defeat the Dark Lord...

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:08.190
It's really impressive. I think I finally see
why people call him a hero.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:09.770
I see.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.650
I'll do my best, too.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.230
Yes.

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:15.650
Let's go back.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:22.690
King Kyle is a hero...

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:26.650
But he disappeared...

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.400
There is more to that dream.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.270
More?

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:36.400
Mr. Kasel enters the world as a hero
and rushes down on a path of war.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:39.650
Further down the path, he disappears.

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:44.190
A Demon!

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.350
Frey!

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:50.190
Kasel, until we reach the World Tree,

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:53.690
you must not, under any circumstances,
use the power of the Holy Sword.

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:18.690
Kasel! Stay there!

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:35.630
Roi!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.060
Stay back!

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:40.980
This sound...

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:54.020
Kasel!

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:11.100
I felt that. I won't let him escape.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:19.770
I'm sorry, I...

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:23.230
What's done is done. We should hurry.

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:36.310
There's no escape for you.

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:38.310
Malduk!

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:39.600
Is that...?

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.810
Ah, it's you, Pavel.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.440
It's been 100 years, hasn't it?

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.810
So you were the one pulling the strings.

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:56.020
Who is that?

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.270
Let me introduce him.

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:05.900
This is the Dark Lord Angmund,
who arrived from the dimensional rift.

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:07.520
The Dark Lord Angmund!

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:08.770
That's him?!

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:15.100
My lord, it seems the humans are at a loss
for words due to their fear of you.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:20.270
Even with their feeble minds,
they are able to comprehend

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:24.520
how profound your presence is
and how beautiful your dark powers are.

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.650
Is that really the Dark Lord...?

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:30.650
Fools. Bow down to the Dark Lord now
and become our servants.

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:35.730
Perhaps then we may forgive
your past insubordination.

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:38.980
I'd rather die than become your servant!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:42.190
Then I will grant you that wish!

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:46.400
I'll grant you a second death.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:06.230
Is that the best you can do, priestess?

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:15.690
Damn you... I'll crush you all!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:59.650
I'll go.

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:06.520
What immense power...

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:11.650
Incomplete...

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.980
The Dark Lord...?!

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.560
Master Lorraine?

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:33.270
We survived...

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:35.940
Why did you help us?

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:40.850
He needs care quickly.

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:49.940
Master Pavel, stay with us...

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:07.020
Master Lorraine,
the treant servant has returned.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:13.270
Kasel...?

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.520
Pavel!

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.690
Master Lorraine and I
were just discussing this.

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:35.560
We did notice that something was happening.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:38.350
So the Dark Lord has indeed returned.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:43.690
Yes... I'm sorry I wasn't able to prevent it.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:48.770
Please, I understand that
you tried as hard as you could.

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:51.350
It must have been quite a difficult journey.

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:56.440
We're so close to getting
the final seal unlocked...

00:14:56.440 --> 00:15:00.310
Master Pavel is okay, right?
He's going to be fine, right?

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:03.980
Let's let Master Lorraine
take care of him for now and wait.

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:07.980
Is the Forest of Elidora all right?

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:13.810
Yes. We worked with the friends of
the forest to repel the Demons. But...

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:16.980
I feel that the situation
is getting more difficult.

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:18.400
I see...

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:22.060
Pavel is not regaining consciousness.

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:26.310
A powerful sorcerer like Pavel
receiving so much damage...

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:28.440
It must have been the Dark Lord, correct?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:32.850
Yes. A single blow from
the Dark Lord sent us all flying.

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:38.940
Pavel doesn't have much time.
I will need to borrow power from the forest.

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:41.480
Selene, please take care of them.

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:42.940
Yes.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:49.020
Everyone, please rest now while you can.

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:55.150
Master Lorraine's power can hide
your presence here, to some degree.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:57.020
Thank you.

00:15:57.020 --> 00:16:00.350
I'll make you a warm drink.

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:09.270
Miss Selene?

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:11.310
What's wrong?

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:13.400
I was just thinking about something...

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:16.440
If it helps, would you like to share it?

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:25.940
I used to admire the previous warrior
of the Holy Sword, King Kyle.

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:31.810
I thought I would protect the forest,
like he protected his people.

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:34.810
That this was my destiny.

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:40.520
But now that the Dark Lord is back,
I am just scared.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.390
I am ashamed of myself.

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:43.810
Don't be.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:49.350
I also tensed up when I saw
the Dark Lord for the first time.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:50.600
You did?

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:58.020
Yes. But at the same time, I felt determined
that I'm going to take him down.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:04.690
Kasel, you appear more reliable
than the last time I saw you a while ago.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.650
It's thanks to everyone else.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:09.350
You must trust your friends
from the bottom of your heart.

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:12.350
Yes. And you're a precious
friend too, Miss Selene.

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.650
What? Me, too...?

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:21.270
I wouldn't have made it here
if it wasn't for every single person I met.

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:23.810
Thank you for your past and ongoing support.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:27.600
Y-You're welcome!

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:38.980
Did he come over here just to encourage me...?

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:17.150
Hey, Chibi, long time no see.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:20.690
I knew you'd be here.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:26.810
Chibi must be watching over us,
right next to Lua.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:28.150
Yeah.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:38.480
Lua, great Goddess of Light,
please guide us to your salvation...

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:42.230
That's too bad. Lua won't save you.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.350
What do you mean?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:55.100
The Holy Sword is Lua's Curse.

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:58.810
Will you become Lua's puppet as well?

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:02.350
What did you mean when you said,
"the Holy Sword is Lua's Curse"?

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:04.310
I meant it literally.

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:06.480
More importantly, I have to talk to you about--

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:07.980
Get back!

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:14.850
Selene, lower your bow.

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:20.100
It has been a long time, Maria...

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:24.270
Oh, you can tell who I am?
Impressive, Lorraine.

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:29.440
Why the sad look?

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:33.690
Why not celebrate our 100-year reunion?

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:38.940
You were a saintess,
but now you're a Demon...

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.440
Saintess...?

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:45.940
I decided to follow Lea, not Lua. That's all.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:51.230
As long as you are a Demon,
I have to take you down.

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:54.350
I don't want to slay a former ally...

00:19:54.350 --> 00:20:00.230
After King Kyle disappeared,
we couldn't find out where you went at all.

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:03.560
I didn't know you were in so much pain
that you became a Demon...

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:08.850
If you had come back to us,
we might have been able to save you!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:14.020
Save? What a hollow, silly phrase.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:18.060
Neither you nor I could have saved Kyle.

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:21.940
That's why I said praying to Lua is meaningless.

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:28.150
The Saintess Maria... So...
You used to be a priestess?!

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:31.150
That's right, young priestess.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:38.520
She used to be one of King Kyle's companions,
along with Pavel, Aeatola, and myself.

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:40.560
What?!

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:44.440
You do resemble Kyle somewhat...

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:52.150
Maria... What happened back then?

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:08.770
Let's get inside before we continue.

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:20.060
I gave Pavel the Droplet of Light,
the source of the forest's life force.

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:22.980
Now it's up to his own stamina.

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:25.020
Master Pavel...

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:27.810
I hope he gets better soon...

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:33.440
So? There must be a reason
why this lady saved us.

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:36.520
She said she wanted to talk to Kasel.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:37.850
Talk?

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:44.310
Truth is a very cruel thing.
If you think you're ready to hear it...

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:50.850
Ready to end up in despair
and hate Lua like I did, then sure.

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:54.440
I believe Goddess Lua.

00:21:54.440 --> 00:22:00.940
Yes, as I once did. I had an unwavering
devotion and trust in Lua...

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.230
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.940
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:24.730
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:24.730 --> 00:22:28.770
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:40.190 --> 00:22:45.310
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:51.230
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:22:51.230 --> 00:22:55.850
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:22:55.850 --> 00:23:02.520
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:07.980
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:23:07.980 --> 00:23:10.270
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:23:10.270 --> 00:23:13.650
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:16.310
<i>This one wish</i>

00:23:16.310 --> 00:23:19.190
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:21.940
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:23:21.940 --> 00:23:24.730
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:27.520
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:23:27.520 --> 00:23:30.310
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:23:30.310 --> 00:23:33.150
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:23:33.150 --> 00:23:36.100
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:50.230
Miss Maria, who used to be
King Kyle's companion, tells us her story.

